  "humanSetupInstructions": [
    "1. Create a 'Managers' Empty GameObject. Attach 'GameManager', 'SoundManager', 'EffectsManager', 'PhysicsManager', and 'GlobalPhysicsManager' to it.",
    "2. Create a 'Pusher' object and attach 'PusherMovement'. Assign it a Rigidbody.",
    "3. Create UI Canvas. Attach 'UIManager' to the Canvas object and assign the text and gameobject references in the Inspector.",
    "4. Assign your Coin Prefab to the 'CoinSpawner' component field on your Spawner GameObject.",
    "5. Create the side walls and floor using primitive Cubes. Attach 'ScoreZone' to the prize area and 'SideLossZone' to the side gaps.",
    "6. Ensure all UI references in UIManager (scoreText, coinText, etc.) are explicitly assigned in the Inspector."
  ],
